ev('E-PROJECTION',D/'INDEPENDENT-PROJECTION.json','validation','Actual pinned per-owner native primitive/real KG gzip/fullA owner context removes only Hemodal and changes truthful source attribution. In-memory restoring control reintroduces Hemodal. Not actual full-campaign generated rows.')
