ass=[]
def assess(aid,area,topic,outcome,es,summary,details):ass.append({'assessment_id':aid,'area':area,'topic':topic,'outcome':outcome,'target_ids':[tid],'evidence_ids':es,'summary':summary,'details':details})
assess('A-IDENTITY','identity','Complete neutral owner and all preserved chemical fields','supported',['E-TERM','E-NIST','E-FIELDS','E-CHECKS'],'CHEBI28869 correctly denotes neutral menadioneCAS58-27-5, C11H8O2; exact current InChI/SMILES and SINGLE_INGREDIENT representation agree with official captures. Existing direct lexical matching provenance/own-ID exactMatch remains.','No salt,bisulfite,product formulation,purity,stock or lot identity is imported. All chemical spellings and positive Aquakay/Aquinone/Kappaxin chemical-name uses remain; their retention is not a blanket finished-product equivalence. The historical truncated InChI remains an old event, not the current structure.')
assess('A-ALIAS','identity','Claim-specific bare Hemodal applicability','supported',['E-SCBT','E-BAYER','E-NIST','E-TERM','E-SEMANTICS','E-ISSUE'],'Only unqualified inherited Hemodal is affirmatively ambiguous across documented neutral and bisulfite/derivative materials. REJECTED_LABEL is supported while retaining its exact spelling,kg_microbe source and history.','This is stronger than an ontology brand annotation or missing data: original manufacturer sections report distinct CAS/forms under the same name. NIST/ChEBI/neutralSCBT still support a positive neutral sense. No universal false-name claim, arbitrary generic release or replacement material is inferred. Bayer tablet and injection blocks are kept separate.')
assess('A-SOURCE','scope','Full genuine ATCC proposal/case context','supported',['E-ATCC','E-ORIGIN','E-CHECKS'],'The authentic W08 proposal/case concerns the named menadione solute. ATCC1257 supports Menadione(VitaminK3) while separating the ethanol/water preparation and downstream addition.','One original frozen case/occurrence stays intact.50mg is the source solute input;50mL95%ethanol and50mLwater are separate stock inputs. Neither the flattened50G_PER_L entry nor final stock/medium concentration is approved. All source decisions and historical holds remain unchanged; no component,quantity or source-role rewrite.')
assess('A-PROVENANCE','provenance','Complete history/evidence and authorship','supported',['E-CHECKS','E-FIELDS','E-PRIOR','E-SEAL'],'Inverse removal of exactly one typedLLM evidence,oneLLM history and restoration of one synonym enum reproduces the complete predecessor object. All16 old events and original evidence are ordered/exact.','C authored the exact successor and remains self_review/scientific_review:false in its native response. W02 original four-token needs_curation report is preserved. This reviewer authored infrastructure/constructors, not W08/C Menadione payloads; no infrastructure self-review is included.')
assess('A-RESOLVER','consistency','Actual native nonresolution and bounded projection','supported',['E-CHECKS','E-PROJECTION'],'Native resolution, browser synonym export and label_index remove only Hemodal. The real-KG per-owner row changes only other and truthful source attribution; neutral target,predicate,method,confidence and all other row cells remain.','Actual fullA2956-owner coupled overlay has zero partonomy violations. Restoring the old enum in memory reintroduces the token. Author forced-KG case variants independently recorded are corroborating controls. These are private native primitives, not a future full-generation row or publication vote.')
assess('A-LIMITS','scope','Inherited role,count and release claims','unknown',['E-FIELDS','E-ATCC','E-PROJECTION'],'Imported VITAMIN_SOURCE confidence1.0 and historical107/107 counts remain unchanged and attributed, not newly supported role or export claims.','No current occurrence recount or complete scientific support of the role/confidence is asserted. Actual final generated rows, source selection, all other campaign findings and root acceptance remain separate obligations.')
