review={'schema_version':'1.0.0','review_id':rid,'kind':'record','repository':ins['repository'],'title':'Independent whole Menadione successor and inherited Hemodal disposition','started_at':json.loads((D/'PREPARATION.json').read_bytes())['started_at'].replace('+00:00','Z'),'finished_at':at,'reviewer':{'identity':'Codex /root/step7d_independent_review','kind':'agent','independence':'independent','independence_basis':'Distinct from original W08 payload author and C successor author. Actual histories/proposal provenance inspected. Prior infrastructure/constructor authorship is disclosed and excluded; this is a source-owner review, not self-approval of infrastructure. Shared original primary evidence is not an extra independent vote.'},'skill':'curate-yaml-record (audit-only)','completion':'completed','verdict':'pass_with_limitations','scientific_review':True,'summary':'Exact4fe complete Menadione successor is supported at neutral-substance/source scope. Bare Hemodal nonresolution is justified by actual conflicting forms while positive neutral usage and all other fields remain. Existing finding resolved only in this private candidate; no new finding, application,role or export approval.','source':ins['source'],'scope':{'description':'Entire exact Menadione owner, all fields/history and genuine W08/ATCC context; targeted inherited Hemodal correction and native behavior.','selection':'Exactly candidate4fe793ab, selected predecessord18105cf, authenticA842 before2ffe65c6. No sampling.','coverage':'full','population_size':1,'reviewed_target_ids':[tid],'exclusions':[{'target':'Infrastructure/constructor','reason':'Reviewer authored infrastructure; not part of this scientific vote.'},{'target':'Actual campaign generation,source acceptance,role/export approval','reason':'Separate actual final artifacts and appropriate independent review/root decisions are required.'}]},'targets':targets,'checks':checks,'evidence':evidence,'assessments':ass,'findings':[finding],'actions':[],'limitations':['The native source is a real private review-only Git fixture. Its commit is not an actual worker/campaign head; every original path/hash and literal capture edge is retained.','Original W02 needs_curation and author self_review are preserved as historical/scoped artifacts, not relabeled. This review supplies one independent whole-owner assessment only.','No maintained,worker,GitHub,producer,constructor,config or shared Git mutation; no provider call or full generator run. Private fixture Git and guarded diagnostic rendering are review evidence only.','Other named brand chemical senses are retained, not claims about every historic finished product. Neither missing product detail nor a name alone determines identity.','OriginalATCC stock/flattened-dose, importedrole, historicalcounts and release holds remain. Actual generated rows and full-campaign findings remain separate.','Native per-owner diagnostic uses the actual KG gzip and original fullA owner context with a verified cached official ChEBI label. It does not claim fresh provider retrieval or actual final canonical/currentness.']}
